# case_02_axi_skid directed schedule (benchmark-spec section 2).
# Columns: rst_n s_valid s_data(hex) m_ready
# c0: offer A, sink ready (buffer empty: no transfer yet)
# c1: offer B while sink stalls -> buffered A must hold (mutant drops valid)
# c2: hold B, sink ready -> transfer A, accept B
# c3: offer C -> transfer B, accept C
# c4: no input -> transfer C, drain to empty
1 1 A1 1
1 1 B2 0
1 1 B2 1
1 1 C3 1
1 0 00 1
1 0 00 1
1 0 00 1
1 0 00 1
1 0 00 1
1 0 00 0
1 0 00 0
